  "id": "thalamocortical-system",
  "term": "thalamocortical system",
  "definition": "The thalamocortical system is the network linking the thalamus and the cerebral cortex that helps support consciousness. It carries sensory input upward and combines it with reciprocal signaling between the cortex and thalamus, making it important in shifts between conscious and unconscious states.",
